MCSTAR,	JA	.		/THIS ROUTINE PRINTS "N" PUTS ASTERISKS INTO THE BUFFER.
	JLE	MCSTAR		/RETURN IF ZERO OR NEGATIVE.
	FNEG
	ATX	1		/PLACE NEGATED COUNT INTO AN INDEX REGISTER.
MCSLOP,	FLDA	MC252		/A STAR.
	JSA	MCPUTC		/OUT IT GOES.
	JXN	MCSLOP,1+
	JA	MCSTAR		/RETURN NOW.
