/
/
/
/
/
/
/
MCLBLK,	JA	.		/THIS ROUTINE PRINTS LEADING BLANKS.
	JLE	MCLBLK		/IF ZERO RETURN NOW.
	FNEG			/ELSE NEGATE THE AC.
	ATX	0		/AND PLACE NUMBER OF BLANKS IN INDEX.
MCBBLP,	FLDA	MC240		/GET A BLANK IN THE AC.
	JSA	MCPUTC		/AND STORE IT AWAY.
	JXN	MCBBLP,0+	/LOOP UNITL DONE.
	JA	MCLBLK		/THEN RETURN.
